    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) on a **TYRANIDS MONSTER** unit of yours not yet picked to move this phase. For the rest of the phase, when its models make a [Normal move](vsdata:core-rule/normal-move), [Advance move](vsdata:core-rule/advance-move) or [Fall Back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back):\n\n- they can pass through models, except **TITANIC** models\n- they can pass through terrain features up to 4\" tall\n- they can cross enemy [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) but can't end the move inside it\n- they can also pass through terrain taller than 4\", but then roll a D6 once the unit has moved: on a 1, it is [Battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock)",
